* NMOS Transistor Q_N
M1 4 3 7 7 NCH

* PMOS Transistor Q_P
M2 4 2 6 6 PCH

* Connections
* Net 3 connects to the gate of Q_N
* Net 7 connects to the source of Q_N
* Net 4 connects to the drain of both Q_N and Q_P
* Net 2 connects to the gate of Q_P
* Net 6 connects to the source of Q_P
* Net 5 is the ground connection for the circuit